@host = http://localhost:9805

### 1. sse, 记录sessionId是第一步返回值，后续步骤用到
GET {{host}}/sse
Accept: application/json


### 2. 初始化阶段：建立连接与能力协商
POST {{host}}/mcp/messages?sessionId=a59223e4-4bb1-4f0b-8328-a9ad5bd1ec57
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2024-11-05",
    "capabilities": {
      "roots": {
        "listChanged": true
      },
      "sampling": {},
      "elicitation": {}
    },
    "clientInfo": {
      "name": "ExampleClient",
      "title": "Example Client Display Name",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  }
}

### 3. 发送 initialized 通知，表明客户端已准备就绪
POST {{host}}/mcp/messages?sessionId=a59223e4-4bb1-4f0b-8328-a9ad5bd1ec57
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "notifications/initialized"
}

### 4. 查询工具列表
POST {{host}}/mcp/messages?sessionId=a59223e4-4bb1-4f0b-8328-a9ad5bd1ec57
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "tools/list",
  "params": {},
  "id": 1
}

### 5. 调用阶段：执行具体工具
POST {{host}}/mcp/messages?sessionId=a59223e4-4bb1-4f0b-8328-a9ad5bd1ec57
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "getWeather",
    "arguments": {
      "city": "北京"
    }
  },
  "id": 1
}

### 6. 工具变更阶段：处理工具列表更新
POST {{host}}/mcp/messages?sessionId=a59223e4-4bb1-4f0b-8328-a9ad5bd1ec57
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "notifications/tools/list_changed",
  "params": {}
}